{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>מפיץ</b> — missing nun, like <b>מפץ אתה לי</b>, and it is a noun of instrument; likewise <b>נו\"ן נשיתי טובה</b>, and <b>צור ילדך תשי</b>. The proper form is <b>תנשי</b> on the pattern of <b>תטעי</b>." "<b>עד שקר</b> — testimony, and it is a noun. It is also possible that it is an adjective, i.e., a man who is a false witness."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The prooftexts cited (נשיתי, תשי) appear corrupt or abbreviated; translated hyper-literally as they stand."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:40.928216898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}